SheetDemo: play it [`c4n d4v e8n f8v | g2n r4 a'4.v`]sheet:hide
# a `tones` tag sounds the pitches; nothing is engraved from it
SheetTones: play it [`c4 d4 e8 f8 | g2 r4 a'4`]tones:hide [60]metro
# a `sheet` tag is silent unless it opts in with a `tones` modifier
SheetHeard: play it [`c4 d4 e8 f8 | g2 r4 a'4`]sheet:hide [60]metro
# engraved line and sounded pitches, kept separate — here a drone under the written line
SheetDrone: play it [`c4 d4 e8 f8 | g2`]sheet:hide [`c,1 g,1`]tones:hide [60]metro
ScalesSheet: play it [ss(`galamian markov`)]scale
# ScalesDS: [ss(`123456`)]position [s('markov, ')]scale [keyPlain]key [ss(`–, v, h, r`)]random [ss(`12`)]

# two 4/4 measures: eight beats shuffled from ten choices — eighth pairs, quarters, ghosts (crossed noteheads) and pauses.
# the bow alternates across sounding notes only, so a pause does not consume one.
BowedTies: play it [ExBowedTies.gen()]sheet:mono [60]metro
